OL,12,Fweather. A few scattered showers in
OL,13,Fthe west at first, these spreading
OL,14,Feast in the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBright
OL,17,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,18,FSunday. Mostly dry on Monday then rain
OL,19,Fspreading east.later. Showers or
OL,20,Flonger spells of rain on Tuesday.
